OL,3,AWhy the PM could finally drop the
OL,4,Atriple lock pension pledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe triple lock, which in theory
OL,7,Fexpires at the end of this Parliament,
OL,8,Fmeans state pensions rise every April
OL,9,Fby at least 2.5%, or in line with the
OL,10,Fhighest of prices or earnings.
